/-- **`ν Johnson.PentagonalOrthobirotunda.polyhedron` is the largest scale of the roots of its system**, each of which has exactly one root: the list form of `johnsonPentagonalOrthobirotunda_nu_roots`. -/
theorem johnsonPentagonalOrthobirotunda_nu_roots_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootMax [johnsonPentagonalOrthobirotunda_nu_system_0] Johnson.PentagonalOrthobirotunda.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
  PolynomialSystem.IsMaxSingle.isRootMax_of_one_var johnsonPentagonalOrthobirotunda_exact_list.1 (by decide) (by decide +kernel)

/-- **System 0 of `ν Johnson.PentagonalOrthobirotunda.polyhedron` has exactly one root**: one real point with every variable in its interval solves its equations. -/
theorem johnsonPentagonalOrthobirotunda_nu_system_0_oneRoot : johnsonPentagonalOrthobirotunda_nu_system_0.HasUniqueRoot :=
